---
layout: "base.njk"
title: "Arcade Games & Pinball | Happy Valley Arcade Bar, Beacon NY"
activeNav: "games"
description: "The full lineup at our Beacon arcade: 30 arcade cabinets from the golden age to modern hits, plus a rotating row of pinball machines."
permalink: "/games-color.html"
copyNote: "."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section class="mhead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">The Floor</span>
    <h1>Games</h1>
    <p>{{ games.intro | safe }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cat-head"><h2>Arcade Cabinets</h2><div class="line"></div></div>
    <div class="cat-note">{{ games.cabinets_note | safe }}</div>
    <div class="game-grid">
      {%- for g in games.cabinets %}
      <div class="game"><span class="nm">{{ g.name | safe }}</span><span class="yr">{{ g.year | safe }}</span></div>
      {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="neo">
        <div class="nm">{{ games.neogeo_title | safe }}</div>
        <ul>
          {%- for g in games.neogeo %}
          <li><b>{{ g.name | safe }}</b> {{ g.year | safe }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cat-head"><h2>Pinball</h2><div class="line"></div></div>
    <div class="cat-note">{{ games.pinball_note | safe }}</div>
    <div class="pin-grid">
      {%- for g in games.pinball %}
      <div class="pin"><div class="band"></div><div class="in"><h3>{{ g.name | safe }}</h3><span class="yr">{{ g.year | safe }}</span></div></div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <h3>Can't Wait? Play Online</h3>
      <p>Fire up our Web Arcade from anywhere, then come settle the high score in person.</p>
      <a class="btn solid" href="https://arcade.valley.games/">▶ Play the Web Arcade</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>